// CORE-USER-OPEN-FLAGS-30, fixed time@a039d9803ade; NOT_RUN.
// call edges originate at real functions; source macros are not C function calls.
// write edges originate at the actual statement-bearing function.
// data/results are separate from write, no claim of physical file effects.
// Invalid helper return may leave op partly initialized; it is NOT a successful open.
// O_TMPFILE aliases O_DIRECTORY: RESOLVE_CACHED mask is a bitwise expression.
// Full VFS traversal and historical UV-04 return problem are outside scope.
digraph OPEN_FLAGS_30 {
  graph [rankdir=LR, labelloc=t, fontsize=12, label="OF30: normalize / validate / field snapshots / caller returns"];
